            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "3081101",
                    "speaker": "Lisa",
                    "text": "Hey cutie."
                },
                {
                    "id": "3081102",
                    "speaker": "Lisa",
                    "text": "You're going to help me out too? How kind of you."
                },
                {
                    "id": "3081103",
                    "speaker": "Lisa",
                    "text": "Don't hesitate to come to me if you need anything.",
                    "choices": [
                        {
                            "id": "3081104",
                            "text": "What kind of things does a librarian do?",
                            "response": [
                                {
                                    "id": "3081105",
                                    "speaker": "Lisa",
                                    "text": "Good question."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "3081106",
                                    "speaker": "Lisa",
                                    "text": "Basically, things other than that which require brawn... or brains."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "3081107",
                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                    "text": "So... what does that leave?"
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "3081111",
                                    "speaker": "Lisa",
                                    "text": "So you should as well."
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "3081108",
                            "text": "Why would a librarian be at the ruins...?",
                            "response": [
                                {
                                    "id": "3081109",
                                    "speaker": "Lisa",
                                    "text": "Hmm... Good question."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "3081110",
                                    "speaker": "Lisa",
                                    "text": "Well, because Jean trusts me."
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "30802",
            "objective": "Enter the temple",
            "dialogues": []
        },
        {
            "id": "30810",
            "objective": "Talk to Lisa",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "3081201",
                    "speaker": "Lisa",
                    "text": "I guess I could give this a go."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "30803",
            "objective": "Explore the temple's depths",
            "dialogues": []
        },
        {
            "id": "30814",
            "objective": "Talk to Lisa",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "3081401",
                    "speaker": "Lisa",
                    "text": "Dragon of the East, Lion of the South, Wolf of the North, Falcon of the West..."
                },
                {
                    "id": "3081402",
                    "speaker": "Lisa",
                    "text": "They are the Four Winds of Mondstadt, affiliated with Barbatos, the God of Anemo."
                },
                {
                    "id": "3081403",
                    "speaker": "Lisa",
                    "text": "The Dragon of the East, Stormterror — its real name, is Dvalin."
                },
                {
                    "id": "3081404",
                    "speaker": "Lisa",
                    "text": "Though most in Mondstadt seem to have forgotten that in all this \"Stormterror\" business."
                },
                {
                    "id": "3081405",
                    "speaker": "Lisa",
                    "text": "So now you know why Dvalin is only able to channel three of the Four Winds' power."
                },
                {
                    "id": "3081406",
                    "speaker": "Lisa",
                    "text": "Because it has been consuming itself from the beginning.",
                    "choices": [
                        {
                            "id": "3081407",
                            "text": "Why?",
                            "response": [
                                {
                                    "id": "3081409",
                                    "speaker": "Lisa",
                                    "text": "Because of hatred, I presume."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "3081410",
                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                    "text": "Hatred...?"
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "3081411",
                                    "speaker": "Lisa",
                                    "text": "Hatred for Mondstadt."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "3081412",
                                    "speaker": "Lisa",
                                    "text": "Hatred drove it to become something more powerful than the wind itself — to become Stormterror."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "3081413",
                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                    "text": "But why would one of The Four Winds..."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "3081414",
                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                    "text": "Hate the city it was supposed to protect?"
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "3081415",
                                    "speaker": "Lisa",
                                    "text": "..."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "3081416",
                                    "speaker": "Lisa",
                                    "text": "As a child of Mondstadt, it's something that's really hard to say aloud."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "3081417",
                                    "speaker": "Lisa",
                                    "text": "Here, take this. It's a very old story from more than a century ago."
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "3081408",
                            "text": "Why would it go to such lengths?"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "30804",
            "objective": "Leave Domain",
            "dialogues": []
        },
        {
            "id": "30813",
            "objective": "Additional",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "3081301",
                    "speaker": "Lisa",
                    "text": "Even standing out here, the disturbance of the elemental flow inside is making me uncomfortable."
                },
                {
                    "id": "3081302",
                    "speaker": "Lisa",
                    "text": "Let's get this temple back to its normal state, so I can be a little less... tense."
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
